LEGAL NOTICE — NOT LEGAL ADVICE (binding over the license grant above)

RAGNAR is a decision-support and drafting engine. It is NOT a lawyer, it does
not provide Rechtsberatung, and it does not file anything with any court.

1. Every COURT_FACING document produced by this engine requires review and
   sign-off by a qualified human lawyer (Rechtsanwalt/Rechtsanwältin) before it
   touches a court, an authority, or an opponent (§ 3 RDG; § 138 ZPO
   Wahrheitspflicht — see docs/EPISTEMOLOGY.md for why this is a feature of
   the architecture, not a disclaimer).

2. The citation registry is time-stamped legal knowledge with a shelf life
   (reverify date: 2027-01-27). Case law moves. Reverify before relying.

3. The operators of this software are personally responsible for the truth of
   every factual assertion they feed into it. The engine renders "[offen]"
   rather than inventing facts — keep it that way.
